# Optional. Without it, the GitHub section reads the contribution heatmap from your public
# github.com contributions page. With it, the heatmap comes from the official GraphQL API instead
# (more reliable) and the REST rate limit goes up from 60 to 5,000 requests an hour.
# Create a fine-grained token at https://github.com/settings/personal-access-tokens/new
# (no extra permissions needed — public data only), then copy this file to .env.local.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
